v><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0499016\">楯【大】，盾【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0499017\">以是義故＝是故【三】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0499017\">以是義故【大】＊，是故【宋】＊【元】＊【明】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500001\">杖＝仗【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500001\">杖【大】，仗【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500002\">觀＋（察）【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500002\">觀【大】，觀察【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500003\">（五）＋陰【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500003\">陰【大】，五陰【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500004\">婦女＝婦人【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500004\">婦女【大】，婦人【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500005\">此＝五【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500005\">此【大】，五【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500006\">過＝及【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500006\">過【大】，及【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500007\">可＝有【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500007\">可【大】，有【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500008\">（是）＋內【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500008\">內【大】，是內【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500009\">虛空＝空虛【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0500009\">虛空【大】，空虛【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501001\">姓＝性【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501001\">姓【大】，性【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501b0901\">能摧【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，摧能【大】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501002\">不＝亦【宋】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501002\">不【大】，亦【宋】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501003\">駛＝駃【宋】【宮】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501003\">駛【大】＊，駃【宋】【宮】＊</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501004\">渡＝度【三】【宮】下同</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501004\">渡【大】下同，度【宋】【元】【明】【宮】下同</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501005\">習＝集【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501005\">習【大】，集【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501006\">毫釐＝豪末【宋】，毫末【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501006\">毫釐【大】，豪末【宋】，毫末【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501007\">習＝集【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501007\">習【大】，集【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501008\">乃＝及【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501008\">乃【大】，及【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501009\">拔＝救【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501009\">拔【大】，救【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501c2401\">一【CB】【麗-CB】，［－］【大】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501010\">渡＝度【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0501010\">渡【大】，度【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502001\">渡＝度【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502001\">渡【大】，度【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502002\">誠＝義【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502002\">誠【大】，義【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502003\">皆悉＝悉皆【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502003\">皆悉【大】，悉皆【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502004\">天中＝大【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502004\">天中【大】，大【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502005\">〔有〕－【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502005\">有【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502006\">差＝瘥【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502006\">差【大】，瘥【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502007\">〔貧故〕－【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502007\">貧故【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502008\">揵＝健【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502008\">揵【大】，健【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502009\">礙＝邊【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502009\">礙【大】，邊【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502010\">〔於〕－【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0502010\">於【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】</div><div